{"description":"Define the driver trust and authoring story: a driver is `{tool,cmd,args}`; a KNOWN driver requires a pinned exact version + checksum, and an unknown/unpinned driver is refused (fail-closed). Vendor CLI adapters (Claude Code, Codex) pin exact vendor CLI versions; their `@agentclientprotocol/*` transitive dependencies are pinned and audited. Extends ADR-028 beyond install-time plugins.","acceptanceCriteria":"A known driver is accepted only with a pinned version + matching checksum; an unknown/unpinned driver is refused.\nAdapters pin exact vendor CLI versions; the adapter dependency set is pinned and audited.\nCapability probing is recorded to a fixed `capabilities.json` with a golden test.\nAn unknown tool fails with a deterministic error."}